      "writtenOn": "2019-08-16T20:43:42Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t think it is worth it: we reset here as soon as an issue is detected, there is no reason for the issue not to reoccur after reboot since we are not modifying the flash contents.",
      "parentUuid": "a9407909_2d76bd7f",
      "revId": "3d62e6019dd8b7a84ce380858869b06dd7e3ef11",
